I had a decent game going where I wasted a throne wish for a CoMR
rather than a ring of levitation. Earlier I had lost a bunch of
unidentified rings in a polypiling mishap in addition to a stack of
smoky potions of levitation along with the two guaranteed scrolls of
earth from Sokoban. No wands of cold or fire were found. No liquor
stores, no jewelry shops, no jumping boots.
Inevitably I reached Medusa's lair and couldn't get across. I dried up
every fountain in the vain desire for a wish to no avail and then was
turned to stone by a cockatrice.
Has anyone ever been in this sort of situation? Have you been able to
persevere and eventually ascend or at the very least reach the Valley
of the Dead? How did you do it? I think it'd be nice if there was a
situation where one could get a guaranteed ring of levitation even if
it was a 25% chance of the situation arising in the game like a
bigroom or knox.


